  "imagePrompt": "The same grand town square in cold grey early morning: figures of light with chisels working on five tall blocks of stone that are painted into five faceless robed statues standing in a row; across later generations lamps placed at their feet, then offerings, then crowds kneeling, the townspeople's lights growing dimmer and the statues' shadows longer; a thin wisp of black smoke curling around their bases; finally night, the statues lit from below by many lamps towering over a kneeling crowd, shadows stretching across the town, and far away on a hill a single small light of steady white standing alone, the name Nuh written softly in white-gold calligraphy in the night sky above it; parchment texture, no faces.",
